C:Frédéric Chopin
O:Waltz in A minor, B. 150 (posthumous)
N:The first strain only (bars 1-16, with its repeat written out). The second
N:strain climbs far above the recorder's A5 and is left out. Transposed down a
N:tone from A minor to G minor, so the first note is D4 and the highest A5. Melody
N:from the flutetunes.com solo flute MIDI, pitches checked against its flute and
N:guitar arrangement. In bar 15 the D6 of the source (C6 here) is written a sixth
N:lower, as A5, to stay within range. Chords from the guitar part of that arrangement.
